umns. Therefore, $A$ is a permutation matrix.\n\nThe inverse of a permutation matrix can be found as follows: \n\n$$\n{P}^{-1}={P}^{T}\n$$\n\nIn our case, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1}={[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}={[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-135367/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6affd858-749d-5a94-854e-ddadd790ae45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-135367"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-135373/selection/595146aca2b430c48652619936c7e54a812a0ddb4985572cd9ca63a64a20c9a2" :answer/id #uuid "e944ae64-ddc8-5c0c-9223-92557c569a0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135373/selection/4e70ff531a106f974d147ce64bc58dc63d470c4083c6387ab9bb0ff4e916159b" :answer/id #uuid "6e65ae82-d321-5e1c-9c99-36c2043eabfc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135373/selection/e388a7cca8d2e26834b368f9d50aee879d7d3f4a6a14a361cf2057cb452c513f" :answer/id #uuid "47197d8c-b7dd-55d7-9543-d94fa8b7da98" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135373/selection/c1418e6fde8d3dd6dacec489b9498b5e4c0842c1bdff3f15a1d6ef9cd6bac371" :answer/id #uuid "a533719f-d015-5e84-9322-0769b57bc07f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135373/selection/6ae180ddec9ff10665065db0ddfa998eaab4b56